{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to our game demo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A sudden power struggle plunges the once peaceful kingdom into the center of a storm. While the king is out hunting, his prime minister colludes with rebels, abducts his young nephew, and ascends to the throne. Even with only 18 loyal and courageous followers, the true king refuses to give up. He vows to fight his way back to the castle, eliminate the rebellion, and reclaim his glory and throne!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/3ab31e8d884f26170d76c7aa4bd9b60d.poster.avif?t=1755743728\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/3ab31e8d884f26170d76c7aa4bd9b60d.webm?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/3ab31e8d884f26170d76c7aa4bd9b60d.mp4?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Players control their troops to fight against an endless stream of enemies. Before the battle begins, you can adjust your troop formations based on the changing scene and equip your soldiers with various equipment. Equipment will make your soldiers even more powerful! Mages, in particular, can use equipment to cast a variety of spells, such as firing light spears, summoning meteorites, teleporting, and even unleashing lightning... After the battle, select your favorite equipment and visit the shop to purchase supplies and replenish your troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/4f55ce8394518b60a1f130cbdebc0d0d.poster.avif?t=1755743728\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/4f55ce8394518b60a1f130cbdebc0d0d.webm?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/4f55ce8394518b60a1f130cbdebc0d0d.mp4?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trial Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Currently, players in the trial version can purchase hundreds of different equipment in the store, recruit nine heroes across three classes, and experience three levels: forest, river, and swamp. Each round, players will face hundreds or even thousands of surging melee and ranged monsters, bringing random challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/5f5fde62cc1031eb82d33fd7f6075177.poster.avif?t=1755743728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/5f5fde62cc1031eb82d33fd7f6075177.webm?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trial Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Due to ongoing development, the current trial version has many shortcomings, such as needing balance adjustments, an inability to view history records, and the inability to unlock additional kings to change game effects. Existing issues will be addressed in future updates or in the official version. We welcome feedback in the reviews or by emailing us directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/ef40592f1c3d4259ddec9e6104682dc4.poster.avif?t=1755743728\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/ef40592f1c3d4259ddec9e6104682dc4.webm?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/ef40592f1c3d4259ddec9e6104682dc4.mp4?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/4396710b612ee3de7f2a82d11970cbc3.poster.avif?t=1755743728\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/4396710b612ee3de7f2a82d11970cbc3.webm?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/extras/4396710b612ee3de7f2a82d11970cbc3.mp4?t=1755743728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952210?t=1755743728","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952210?t=1755743728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/a0c6424c998d49c61834bcdf09ea73e9cf825bed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755743728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952210/a0c6424c998d49c61834bcdf09ea73e9cf825bed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755743728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Cust